  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Hiya. I've, er, I've got a mole on my back that my sister says looks different.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:00",
      "end_timestamp": "00:08",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right. Tell me about it, what's changed?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:10",
      "end_timestamp": "00:14",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, I can't see it myself, my sister spotted it at the swimming baths. She says it's bigger and a bit darker than it was.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:15",
      "end_timestamp": "00:29",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Has anything changed that you've noticed, itching, bleeding, crusting?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:30",
      "end_timestamp": "00:35",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It does itch a bit, now I think about it. Only recently, the last two weeks.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:38",
      "end_timestamp": "00:48",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "When did your sister first notice the change?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:49",
      "end_timestamp": "00:53",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "She said it was a few months back she first noticed, but I'd not taken any notice.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "01:03",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay. Have you any skin conditions I should know about?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:24",
      "end_timestamp": "01:29",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I had eczema as a kid, behind my knees. Not now.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:31",
      "end_timestamp": "01:37",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Those are the features we pay attention to. Most moles like this turn out to be harmless, I'd say this is likely a benign mole, but because it has changed and itches, I can't be certain.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:18",
      "end_timestamp": "03:35",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to take a dermoscopy photograph of it today, and send it to the skin specialists so they can look at it properly.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:41",
      "end_timestamp": "03:53",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Within two weeks, you'll get a letter. If it changes again, bleeds, or you haven't heard in two weeks, ring us.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:49",
      "end_timestamp": "05:00",
